 - `customers.add_customer(name, tier="standard")`: create a customer
 - `customers.outstanding_balance(customer_id)`: total of the customer's open invoices
+- `customers.rebate_for(customer_id)`: volume rebate the customer has earned, in dollars (float). Counts all of the customer's shipments, whatever their status: below `settings.REBATE_REGULAR_MIN_SHIPMENTS` (10) the rebate is 0.0; from 10 it is `settings.REBATE_REGULAR_PCT` (3%), and from `settings.REBATE_BULK_MIN_SHIPMENTS` (50) it is `settings.REBATE_BULK_PCT` (6%), of the total of the customer's paid invoices, rounded half-up to the cent. With no paid invoices the rebate is 0.0. Valid input: the id of an existing customer. Idempotent (read-only, emits no event).
+  - `E_NOT_FOUND`: no customer with that id
 
